WEBVTT

00:00:14.980 --> 00:00:19.310
How? I know I buried you myself!

00:00:22.850 --> 00:00:24.230
It can't be...

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:27.650
Dad?

00:02:00.090 --> 00:02:05.100
Four years earlier

00:02:11.100 --> 00:02:14.850
Why?! Why isn't my wish fulfilled?!

00:02:16.060 --> 00:02:18.690
Raising the dead--

00:02:18.690 --> 00:02:23.980
It requires the greatest of skill,
even among Magonian powers.

00:02:23.980 --> 00:02:26.810
If only I could find a Magonian witch...

00:02:26.810 --> 00:02:33.520
The source of Magonian power is
the strength of people's hopes and wishes.

00:02:33.520 --> 00:02:37.940
You have the perfect person
to utilize for that, do you not?

00:02:37.940 --> 00:02:40.310
You don't mean... Rugis?

00:02:40.310 --> 00:02:45.730
Duke Rugis is a hero known
to all throughout the kingdom.

00:02:45.730 --> 00:02:49.400
You're saying I should use
the hopes and desires within him?

00:02:49.400 --> 00:02:54.650
Those, as well as the strength
of will that he possesses.

00:02:54.650 --> 00:02:57.310
But to use one of my subjects so...

00:02:57.310 --> 00:03:00.520
Are you forgetting about those suspicions?

00:03:00.520 --> 00:03:03.900
About how he objected to you
cutting off your support last year,

00:03:03.900 --> 00:03:06.850
and was soliciting soldiers
to overthrow the kingdom?

00:03:09.150 --> 00:03:12.400
Please give me your decision, Your Majesty.

00:03:12.400 --> 00:03:16.480
That we may thwart Duke Rugis's plot.
And more importantly,

00:03:16.480 --> 00:03:19.980
to fulfill Your Majesty's wish.

00:03:26.060 --> 00:03:29.060
My soldiers are exhausted from fighting Daire,

00:03:29.060 --> 00:03:32.230
and the people are stretched
to the breaking point.

00:03:32.230 --> 00:03:35.100
Your Majesty, for the sake
of the Camellian people,

00:03:35.100 --> 00:03:37.480
please extend your support once again.

00:03:37.480 --> 00:03:41.600
You have not achieved much
of anything militarily for many years,

00:03:41.600 --> 00:03:44.440
but your demands, at least, are full strength.

00:03:44.440 --> 00:03:46.900
Much to my great shame.

00:03:46.900 --> 00:03:51.730
I thought I ordered you to claim
the head of Daire's emperor.

00:03:51.730 --> 00:03:54.560
The fact that you still have not accomplished that

00:03:54.560 --> 00:03:58.480
means that it is beyond
your power to do so, doesn't it?!

00:03:58.480 --> 00:04:01.690
You are indeed correct.

00:04:01.690 --> 00:04:05.730
The strongest, the most primitive of emotions.

00:04:05.730 --> 00:04:08.520
You must trigger his anger.

00:04:08.520 --> 00:04:11.940
His anger will bring out the Magonian power?

00:04:11.940 --> 00:04:17.690
Your Majesty, your words must
cause him to let go of his inhibitions.

00:04:17.690 --> 00:04:19.900
Once you were set up as a Templar knight,

00:04:19.900 --> 00:04:21.940
have you grown overconfident
in your own abilities?!

00:04:21.940 --> 00:04:26.400
Your Majesty! Rugis is a loyal subject
who has risked his life for the kingdom!

00:04:26.400 --> 00:04:27.480
What you are saying is--

00:04:27.480 --> 00:04:28.770
Don't, Leon!

00:04:28.770 --> 00:04:29.770
But...

00:04:29.770 --> 00:04:34.810
The Templar knights now conspire
with each other. Oh, I get it now!

00:04:34.810 --> 00:04:38.810
You're planning to add Olivier to
your little revolt now, too, aren't you?!

00:04:38.810 --> 00:04:41.270
Seize these two!

00:04:41.270 --> 00:04:43.980
Have you lost your mind, Your Majesty?!

00:04:43.980 --> 00:04:49.400
Rugis! Did you think I was unaware
of your plot to overthrow the kingdom?!

00:04:49.400 --> 00:04:54.650
Send our soldiers into Camellia!
Burn this traitor's land to the ground!

00:04:54.650 --> 00:04:56.520
Why, you...!

00:05:02.600 --> 00:05:06.980
What's the matter, Rugis?
What are you so angry about?

00:05:06.980 --> 00:05:12.350
This betrayal... This anger...

00:05:12.350 --> 00:05:19.020
Is this how you reward your loyal retainers?!

00:05:21.980 --> 00:05:25.150
What is this?

00:05:25.150 --> 00:05:29.810
Oh, I can feel it! Your body is brimming...

00:05:29.810 --> 00:05:33.190
...with unimaginable power!

00:05:33.190 --> 00:05:34.730
What is happening here?

00:05:39.520 --> 00:05:41.900
What...

00:05:41.900 --> 00:05:43.440
...the hell...

00:05:43.440 --> 00:05:45.730
...have you done?!

00:05:57.330 --> 00:06:04.170
December 5th, 771, New Holy Era

00:05:58.770 --> 00:06:00.060
Snow?

00:06:00.060 --> 00:06:01.770
What's wrong <i>moru</i> ?

00:06:01.770 --> 00:06:06.480
I heard from Maurice that the night
Fernando passed away,

00:06:06.480 --> 00:06:08.020
it was snowing.

00:06:08.020 --> 00:06:11.060
It was <i>moru</i> .

00:06:11.060 --> 00:06:13.480
Do you know where the others were heading?

00:06:13.480 --> 00:06:14.650
<i>Moru</i> ?

00:06:14.650 --> 00:06:16.560
I have to go to them!

00:06:18.270 --> 00:06:19.730
It can't be...

00:06:19.730 --> 00:06:21.440
It isn't possible.

00:06:21.440 --> 00:06:22.980
How can my brother be...?

00:06:24.730 --> 00:06:26.310
Stop, Fernando!

00:06:26.310 --> 00:06:27.520
Please keep back!

00:06:27.520 --> 00:06:28.400
But...

00:06:28.400 --> 00:06:30.150
We will take care of this.

00:06:33.350 --> 00:06:36.810
His swordsmanship--
it is definitely my father's.

00:06:38.440 --> 00:06:40.350
Damn you, Vall d'Hebron.

00:06:42.650 --> 00:06:44.440
Stop this, Brother!

00:06:51.190 --> 00:06:52.190
Are you all right?!

00:06:52.190 --> 00:06:53.520
Don't get distracted!

00:07:02.310 --> 00:07:05.400
Defeat me.

00:07:05.400 --> 00:07:10.480
My body is being controlled by the pope;
there is nothing I can do.

00:07:10.480 --> 00:07:14.520
Unless you stop me, I will kill all of you.

00:07:14.520 --> 00:07:16.730
It can't be...

00:07:16.730 --> 00:07:19.520
You must strike me down, Adelheid.

00:07:19.520 --> 00:07:21.100
I can't do that!

00:07:23.560 --> 00:07:29.150
Please, my daughter. Set me free.

00:07:29.150 --> 00:07:30.690
Father...

00:07:37.400 --> 00:07:39.310
Maurice!

00:07:39.310 --> 00:07:42.520
I won't let you do this.
No matter what it takes,

00:07:42.520 --> 00:07:45.980
I will defend the princess and Alfred!

00:07:45.980 --> 00:07:50.520
That is the oath I swore to you, Brother!

00:07:53.150 --> 00:07:54.980
Run...

00:07:54.980 --> 00:07:56.650
...Maurice!

00:07:59.310 --> 00:08:01.270
Take that last step.

00:08:02.650 --> 00:08:04.600
Surpass me.

00:08:07.770 --> 00:08:12.940
Dad, if your soul is being held captive,
then I will save you!

00:08:12.940 --> 00:08:15.940
I will protect all that I love!

00:08:15.940 --> 00:08:19.230
That is my code of chivalry!

00:08:19.230 --> 00:08:21.810
Measure the reach that holds
the chance for victory.

00:08:21.810 --> 00:08:23.940
By doing so, I can...

00:08:23.940 --> 00:08:26.100
...relieve Father from his agony!

00:08:31.100 --> 00:08:34.440
I did it! For the first time,
I bested you, Father!

00:08:36.310 --> 00:08:37.850
Nicely done.

00:08:37.850 --> 00:08:40.440
You've worked hard, haven't you, Adelheid.

00:08:42.980 --> 00:08:44.060
Yes!

00:08:50.940 --> 00:08:52.150
Father...

00:08:53.850 --> 00:09:01.440
I am so happy that once again,
I could exchange words and blows with you...

00:09:03.310 --> 00:09:10.100
You've gotten strong, Alfred.
The day when you surpass me is not far off.

00:09:10.100 --> 00:09:16.440
I've seen for myself how much
you've grown. I offer my gratitude.

00:09:16.440 --> 00:09:18.350
Dad...

00:09:18.350 --> 00:09:23.400
There's so much I want to say to you...
so much I want you to tell me...

00:09:23.400 --> 00:09:27.900
Your feelings reached me
through the strike of your blade.

00:09:27.900 --> 00:09:30.650
You must have felt it, too.

00:09:30.650 --> 00:09:37.020
Now, move forward, together with the princess.
I will continue praying

00:09:37.020 --> 00:09:41.730
that your future will be one of good fortune...

00:09:50.440 --> 00:09:51.600
Dad...

00:09:58.690 --> 00:10:01.350
My brother is something else, all right.

00:10:02.480 --> 00:10:03.440
Maurice!

00:10:03.440 --> 00:10:05.350
We'll get you treated right away!

00:10:05.350 --> 00:10:07.580
You two go on ahead.

00:10:07.580 --> 00:10:08.000
Huh?

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:10.060
What are you talking about?!

00:10:10.060 --> 00:10:14.270
Look at the shape I'm in.
I'll just slow you down.

00:10:16.020 --> 00:10:20.690
Besides, I want to spend
a little more time with my brother.

00:10:22.060 --> 00:10:23.150
All right.

00:10:23.150 --> 00:10:25.600
Please, don't let anything happen to you.

00:10:30.400 --> 00:10:36.270
This is enough, isn't it, Brother?
I've kept them safe,

00:10:36.270 --> 00:10:39.980
and in the end, I got to fight you.

00:10:39.980 --> 00:10:42.770
I can now die a happy... man...

00:10:56.560 --> 00:10:59.100
Are you sure this is the right way?

00:10:59.100 --> 00:11:03.900
It should be this way <i>moru</i> .
We have to cross here <i>moru</i> .

00:11:03.900 --> 00:11:07.350
Ooh, there's something in the water...

00:11:10.270 --> 00:11:11.270
Huh?

00:11:12.400 --> 00:11:14.020
Deflotte?

00:11:14.020 --> 00:11:16.350
What are you doing here, you two?

00:11:16.350 --> 00:11:19.060
We were worried about Alfred,
and came running to help him <i>moru</i> .

00:11:19.060 --> 00:11:21.310
Wh-Wh-What did you tell him that for?!

00:11:21.310 --> 00:11:22.440
Oh, I see.

00:11:22.440 --> 00:11:24.900
<i>Moru</i> ...

00:11:24.900 --> 00:11:27.850
In that case, we can't stand around here!

00:11:27.850 --> 00:11:28.900
<i>Moru</i> ?

00:11:32.940 --> 00:11:35.520
The pope is on the other side of there.

00:11:35.520 --> 00:11:37.400
Everything is about to come to an end.

00:11:39.230 --> 00:11:43.310
Without you, I never would
have made it this far.

00:11:43.310 --> 00:11:47.190
I took an oath that my sword belonged to you.

00:11:47.190 --> 00:11:49.400
I only did what was right.

00:11:49.400 --> 00:11:53.730
Even so, please allow me to say...
thank you, Alfred.

00:11:55.150 --> 00:11:58.440
Your thanks are more than
I deserve, Princess Marielle--

00:11:58.440 --> 00:12:00.400
Is something the matter?

00:12:00.400 --> 00:12:03.100
No. Come on, let's go.

00:12:09.560 --> 00:12:10.770
Charlot?

00:12:11.770 --> 00:12:14.100
Charlot!

00:12:14.100 --> 00:12:16.980
Sister...?

00:12:16.980 --> 00:12:19.940
What was I just...?

00:12:19.940 --> 00:12:24.600
Thank goodness! I'm so glad you're all right!

00:12:24.600 --> 00:12:26.190
Sister...?

00:12:29.020 --> 00:12:30.980
Vall d'Hebron!

00:12:30.980 --> 00:12:36.100
Reunited with your beloved brother.
A truly touching sight.

00:12:36.100 --> 00:12:41.230
How was it for you--
seeing your father after so long?

00:12:43.480 --> 00:12:45.150
I am grateful to you.

00:12:47.560 --> 00:12:52.440
After exchanging words and blows,
I was able to carry on my father's wishes.

00:12:52.440 --> 00:12:57.230
If you had not used Magonian power,
that miracle would have been impossible.

00:12:57.230 --> 00:13:01.650
Ho, so you knew about that, as well?

00:13:01.650 --> 00:13:04.190
Pope Vall d'Hebron,

00:13:04.190 --> 00:13:08.350
what are you trying to bring about
in this country through Magonian power?

00:13:08.350 --> 00:13:10.600
It is hardly worth bringing up.

00:13:10.600 --> 00:13:14.850
My goal is to preserve the peace in the kingdom.

00:13:14.850 --> 00:13:18.400
Peace does not require
the power to defile the dead

00:13:18.400 --> 00:13:20.520
and to control monsters!

00:13:20.520 --> 00:13:25.270
The most efficient means
of unifying the country

00:13:25.270 --> 00:13:28.520
is to create a common enemy.

00:13:28.520 --> 00:13:34.980
This power is necessary to bring together
and unify the will of the people.

00:13:36.810 --> 00:13:39.100
Charlot, get away from here!

00:13:39.100 --> 00:13:40.100
M-Mm-hmm!

00:13:41.600 --> 00:13:44.850
When an overwhelming threat is closing in,

00:13:44.850 --> 00:13:49.230
even those who are opposed
to each other will join hands. That...

00:13:49.230 --> 00:13:51.520
...is the way that people are.

00:13:51.520 --> 00:13:55.480
And the prayers of those who are
in despair pleading with God

00:13:55.480 --> 00:13:59.310
makes my own power that much stronger.

00:13:59.310 --> 00:14:01.770
Was that why you took on the position of pope?!

00:14:01.770 --> 00:14:06.770
And with all of this gathered power,
I will lead this country

00:14:06.770 --> 00:14:09.980
and bring about everlasting prosperity.

00:14:09.980 --> 00:14:12.940
In the place of the detestable Hortensia family.

00:14:14.400 --> 00:14:19.690
My mother was cast away by your father
after he had his fun with her!

00:14:19.690 --> 00:14:21.440
That's crazy!

00:14:21.440 --> 00:14:27.150
I will bury your family and take control
of this country! That is indeed...

00:14:27.150 --> 00:14:30.350
...my revenge!

00:14:51.600 --> 00:14:54.600
Are those... monsters?

00:14:54.600 --> 00:15:00.440
We are not monsters.
We are beings that possess godlike powers.

00:15:00.440 --> 00:15:04.270
You might best call us diables.

00:15:04.270 --> 00:15:06.480
You would turn to devilish powers?!

00:15:13.600 --> 00:15:15.520
Its wound...!

00:15:15.520 --> 00:15:16.520
Princess!

00:15:18.350 --> 00:15:19.730
Please stay back!

00:15:21.810 --> 00:15:26.400
Do you think that mere mortals
can stand against diables? Hmm...?

00:15:31.900 --> 00:15:32.660
What was that?!

00:15:32.660 --> 00:15:33.730
Incoming!

00:15:36.350 --> 00:15:38.060
It can't be!

00:15:38.060 --> 00:15:39.520
I'm fighting, too!

00:15:39.520 --> 00:15:43.940
Such is the determination and resolve
of one who leads the people!

00:15:43.940 --> 00:15:47.020
This is... the same power as earlier...

00:15:50.480 --> 00:15:52.190
It extends to my sword.

00:15:52.190 --> 00:15:58.060
Impudent fools!
Receive the punishment of my divine wrath!

00:16:04.560 --> 00:16:07.810
Keep going, and vanish into nothingness!

00:16:14.730 --> 00:16:16.100
Duke Rugis!

00:16:16.100 --> 00:16:18.560
What are you doing here?

00:16:18.560 --> 00:16:20.730
Allow me to thank you.

00:16:20.730 --> 00:16:23.440
Thanks to the Liberation Army's
invasion of the capital,

00:16:23.440 --> 00:16:25.730
I was able to come this far without any trouble.

00:16:27.440 --> 00:16:32.650
So that's it. You are a Bearer, too, aren't you?

00:16:32.650 --> 00:16:35.100
It's been four years, Vall d'Hebron.

00:16:35.100 --> 00:16:39.560
I haven't forgotten a moment
of the anger I felt back then.

00:16:39.560 --> 00:16:41.730
It's thanks to that anger of yours

00:16:41.730 --> 00:16:44.100
that the monsters were summoned to this world,

00:16:44.100 --> 00:16:47.480
and terror holds sway over the kingdom.

00:16:47.480 --> 00:16:51.690
My judgment was sound, wasn't it?

00:16:51.690 --> 00:16:53.060
Duke Rugis!

00:16:53.060 --> 00:16:56.560
Does this mean that you didn't stage
that rebellion of your own volition?

00:16:56.560 --> 00:16:58.810
None of that matters now.

00:16:58.810 --> 00:17:04.400
Until we defeat him, we can't bring
an end to this nation's tragedy!

00:17:04.400 --> 00:17:10.060
I, who can control Magonian power,
am the true ruler of this country!

00:17:10.060 --> 00:17:10.900
I need your help!

00:17:10.900 --> 00:17:11.940
Right!

00:17:24.150 --> 00:17:25.150
Go!

00:17:52.100 --> 00:17:55.400
You are every bit Fernando's son.

00:17:55.400 --> 00:17:59.190
I could not have done it without you being here.

00:17:59.190 --> 00:18:01.480
Allow me to offer my thanks, as well.

00:18:02.980 --> 00:18:09.270
I am undeserving of your gratitude.
My fight with him was for another purpose.

00:18:09.270 --> 00:18:11.190
The relic, right?

00:18:11.190 --> 00:18:13.060
You know of it?

00:18:13.060 --> 00:18:16.940
The relic has within it
the power to create conflict.

00:18:16.940 --> 00:18:21.350
It is bound to bring ruin,
even in the hands of an honorable person.

00:18:21.350 --> 00:18:24.770
It must be eliminated from our world.

00:18:24.770 --> 00:18:27.520
Princess Marielle...

00:18:27.520 --> 00:18:31.100
I am certain that you are capable
of reestablishing the kingdom,

00:18:31.100 --> 00:18:33.980
and bringing peace and order back to it.

00:18:33.980 --> 00:18:38.520
I will need heroes such as yourself to do so.

00:18:38.520 --> 00:18:44.440
Rugis, for Hortensia's sake,
will you lend us your assistance once again?

00:18:44.440 --> 00:18:46.400
But Your Highness, I...

00:18:50.060 --> 00:18:53.900
Imagine, being able to witness
a farce such as this...

00:18:53.900 --> 00:18:56.100
You're a tough customer.

00:18:56.100 --> 00:19:00.730
Permit me to tell you the truth of the matter.

00:19:03.650 --> 00:19:04.980
What's that?!

00:19:04.980 --> 00:19:06.400
The sky...!

00:19:08.730 --> 00:19:10.850
Where is the relic?!

00:19:10.850 --> 00:19:13.850
It is no longer here.

00:19:13.850 --> 00:19:18.400
Then you don't need the relic
to use Magonian power?

00:19:18.400 --> 00:19:21.480
It was taken away by Didier.

00:19:21.480 --> 00:19:24.560
It was his to begin with, after all.

00:19:36.850 --> 00:19:38.230
Oh, no...

00:19:40.270 --> 00:19:41.520
You were...

00:19:44.600 --> 00:19:45.940
...the werewolf?!

00:19:47.940 --> 00:19:50.850
What a superb ending to this affair.

00:19:55.060 --> 00:19:56.440
Alfred!

00:20:03.440 --> 00:20:04.520
Rugis...

00:20:04.520 --> 00:20:07.560
How dare you kill Dad and the others...

00:20:07.560 --> 00:20:11.440
...and shatter the happiness of everyone else!

00:20:25.940 --> 00:20:27.560
Alfred!

00:20:34.560 --> 00:20:36.850
Please stay with me, Alfred!

00:20:38.100 --> 00:20:42.100
Princess... are you there...?

00:20:42.100 --> 00:20:45.900
I'm right here next to you!

00:20:45.900 --> 00:20:48.520
Thank goodness... you're safe...

00:20:48.520 --> 00:20:50.230
It's all thanks to you!

00:20:51.600 --> 00:20:55.600
As a knight... my oath to you is...

00:20:55.600 --> 00:21:00.650
Yes. You kept me from harm.

00:21:00.650 --> 00:21:02.060
The other one...

00:21:02.060 --> 00:21:03.980
Huh?

00:21:03.980 --> 00:21:09.150
That when we are alone...
I was to call you Marius, wasn't I...?

00:21:10.980 --> 00:21:15.060
Yeah, that's right.
I'm impressed you remembered.

00:21:16.190 --> 00:21:18.940
I promised... after all...

00:21:20.730 --> 00:21:26.150
Now... your journey has come to an end...

00:21:26.150 --> 00:21:27.310
Which means I...

00:21:27.310 --> 00:21:33.940
I don't accept this! You are the
princess's knight, and my dear friend!

00:21:33.940 --> 00:21:40.100
Moreover, I am your page.
I go with you, no matter what.

00:21:40.100 --> 00:21:43.730
I will not permit you to just pass away.

00:21:43.730 --> 00:21:47.810
You're right... Let's go home to Albert...

00:21:49.940 --> 00:21:51.600
The hill there is waiting for us...

00:21:54.350 --> 00:21:56.150
Once again, you and I...

00:22:03.300 --> 00:22:10.300
Chapter 12

00:22:03.300 --> 00:22:10.300
Promise

00:22:03.300 --> 00:22:10.300
~Once Again, on the Hill at Sunset~

00:22:11.850 --> 00:22:15.310
In order to repair the kingdom that
has been corrupted by the pope,

00:22:15.310 --> 00:22:18.230
I rose up, and have now been able

00:22:18.230 --> 00:22:22.100
to return to the kingdom the future
that it was supposed to have.

00:22:22.100 --> 00:22:28.060
However, this was by no means
accomplished by myself alone.

00:22:28.060 --> 00:22:30.850
Many people have been wounded and struck down,

00:22:30.850 --> 00:22:35.310
their lives lost, during this war.

00:22:35.310 --> 00:22:40.150
Those who laid down their lives for
the sake of the kingdom are indeed heroes!

00:22:56.230 --> 00:22:59.600
The princess has committed a taboo.

00:22:59.600 --> 00:23:02.310
She invoked a hidden power,

00:23:02.310 --> 00:23:04.270
one that should never have been meddled with...

00:23:06.810 --> 00:23:09.150
Alfred!

00:23:29.440 --> 00:23:32.060
She has not realized

00:23:32.060 --> 00:23:34.100
that the death that befell him

00:23:34.100 --> 00:23:36.650
is the unmistakable truth.
